Z||000047||Black88GT||10-11-2000||12:12 AM||||Did anyone see the special on the NRA yesterday?  They said that Al Gore was buddy buddy with the NRA when he needed campaign money for his Tennessee.  Then next thing you know its "pass more gun laws blah blah blah".  <P>About the education thing, its sick to find out how much money public schools get from the government, when private schools can educate kids for a fraction of the cost and usually in a more beneficial way.  I go to a catholic school and my friends and I always joke when we drive down the street, past the local public school and see Lexus', BMW's, Mercedes' in the parking lots, yet the kids can't even read.  Thats real great putting NASA computers in the rooms when the kids can't even turn them on much less use them for "educational" purposes....<BR>If the liberals would actually try to reform something rather then tossing the money down the black hole, things would probably change for the better.<BR>||||reg||1
